1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,911
According to the Ministry of Health,

2
00:00:02,951 --> 00:00:06,216
stroke causes 18.5 percent
of deaths in Indonesia.

3
00:00:07,716 --> 00:00:12,314
Yet only 49.2 percent of people
with stroke have regular check-ups.

4
00:00:13,814 --> 00:00:17,379
Therapists are scarce too:
only 926 physical therapy

5
00:00:17,419 --> 00:00:21,233
staff across more than 10,000
community health centres.

6
00:00:22,733 --> 00:00:25,554
Patients go home with an
exercise programme on paper.

7
00:00:27,133 --> 00:00:30,590
At home, they are unsure whether
they are moving correctly.

8
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:32,645
That is where guidance breaks off.

9
00:00:34,145 --> 00:00:37,726
PULIHIN turns an ordinary phone
into an exercise companion.

10
00:00:37,766 --> 00:00:41,694
Once opened, Today's Exercises
appear right away, in large type.

11
00:00:43,194 --> 00:00:46,741
We start with one small
movement: Elbow Flexion.

12
00:00:46,781 --> 00:00:49,879
There is a movement demo, a safety notice,

13
00:00:49,919 --> 00:00:52,833
then one big button: Start with Camera.

14
00:00:54,333 --> 00:00:58,531
The phone simply sits on a table,
about one metre from the chair.

15
00:00:58,571 --> 00:01:02,744
This is a demonstration with a
3D character, not a real patient.

16
00:01:04,244 --> 00:01:09,162
The real app reads body landmarks right on
the device, without uploading any video.

17
00:01:09,202 --> 00:01:14,040
Repetitions are counted from the elbow
angle: a full bend, then straighten again.

18
00:01:15,540 --> 00:01:18,074
Look at the count: five out of ten.

19
00:01:20,034 --> 00:01:21,680
Now the shoulder hikes up.

20
00:01:22,030 --> 00:01:25,321
[App voice] Relax your shoulder,
lower your shoulder.

21
00:01:25,821 --> 00:01:30,680
The app corrects right away, by voice
and in large text, in Indonesian.

22
00:01:32,180 --> 00:01:34,687
So it is not just counting:
it guards how each

23
00:01:34,727 --> 00:01:37,718
movement is done, all the
way to the tenth repetition.

24
00:01:39,218 --> 00:01:41,731
At the end of the session there is a score

25
00:01:41,771 --> 00:01:44,587
and a simple summary:
repetitions and duration.

26
00:01:44,627 --> 00:01:48,335
The labels are easy to read,
from Needs Support to Very Good.

27
00:01:52,718 --> 00:01:55,141
There is one tip for the next session.

28
00:01:55,181 --> 00:01:59,588
This summary is not a diagnosis,
and that disclaimer always appears.

29
00:02:01,718 --> 00:02:06,114
Back on the home screen, Elbow Flexion
is marked done, with its score.

30
00:02:06,154 --> 00:02:09,450
The exercise is recorded,
and the family can see it.

31
00:02:11,718 --> 00:02:13,726
The family no longer has to guess.

32
00:02:13,766 --> 00:02:17,279
The For Family page shows a flag
when exercise has stopped,

33
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:20,391
today's status, and a chart
of the last seven days.

34
00:02:26,218 --> 00:02:28,381
The 14-day score trend is there too.

35
00:02:28,421 --> 00:02:33,193
The weekly summary can be copied with
one tap, ready to send to the therapist.

36
00:02:39,218 --> 00:02:42,275
For patients with speech
difficulties, or aphasia,

37
00:02:42,315 --> 00:02:46,898
there is Speech Practice in Indonesian,
with words used at home every day.

38
00:02:51,218 --> 00:02:54,901
The example word can be heard first,
then the word is spoken.

39
00:02:55,401 --> 00:02:58,860
In Self-Practice Mode,
the companion scores

40
00:02:58,900 --> 00:03:01,545
with one tap: Correct, or Repeat.

41
00:03:01,585 --> 00:03:03,212
The result is saved.

42
00:03:08,718 --> 00:03:11,997
On the Therapist Dashboard,
the therapist can set the programme

43
00:03:12,037 --> 00:03:14,935
and follow progress without
waiting for the next visit.

44
00:03:19,718 --> 00:03:22,486
In this prototype,
the programme the therapist saves

45
00:03:22,526 --> 00:03:25,334
becomes Today's Exercises on
that patient's profile.

46
00:03:34,218 --> 00:03:36,485
PULIHIN does not replace the therapist.

47
00:03:36,525 --> 00:03:41,140
It helps make sure that what the therapist
teaches is truly practised at home.

48
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:46,269
This is still a competition prototype,
not a regulated medical device.

49
00:03:46,309 --> 00:03:48,510
Try it now at pulihin.vercel.app.
